--[[
@description 7R ReaDancer
@author 7thResonance
@version 0.1
@provides 
  [extension win64] UserPlugins\7R Dancer\reaper_7R_ReaDancer.dll > UserPlugins\reaper_7R_ReaDancer.dll
  [data win64] UserPlugins\7R Dancer\7R ReaDancer\Dance_Large.png > UserPlugins\7R ReaDancer\Dance_Large.png
  [data win64] UserPlugins\7R Dancer\7R ReaDancer\Dance_Large.txt > UserPlugins\7R ReaDancer\Dance_Large.txt
  [effect win64] UserPlugins\7R Dancer\7R_ReaDancer_Energy.jsfx  > Effects\7thResonance\7R_ReaDancer_Energy.jsfx
@about simplified version of FL fruity dancer inspired by peloreaper's extention
        added the following.
            No dedicated window. dancers lives inside reaper's window
            Remebers position of the dancer
            Accompanied JSFX for the dancer to react to configurable energy level fo the track. (monitoring FX)
            Auto Start
            FL chan is the default (its included, whats the worst thing that could happen?)
@changelog - initial release
--]]